<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ÆTHER | About Us</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --charcoal: #2A3330;
            --sage: #74B267;
            --soft-chartreuse: #EBEA8E;
            --misted-stone: #C6CBD1;
            --dusty-rose: #CB7A81;
            --bg-white: #FFFFFF;
            --text-dark: #2A3330;
            --text-light: #5A6B66;
            --border-light: rgba(42, 51, 48, 0.1);
            --shadow-sm: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-white);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .about-container {
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
        }

        /* Page Header */
        .about-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .about-header h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            color: var(--charcoal);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .about-header p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 1rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero-about {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-image-container {
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .hero-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
        }

        .hero-content h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .highlight-quote {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--sage);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--soft-chartreuse);
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        /* Mission & Values Section */
        .mission-values {
            background: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }

        .mission-values h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .value-card {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .value-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            background: rgba(198, 203, 209, 0.05);
        }

        .value-icon {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            margin: 0 auto 1rem;
            background: var(--misted-stone);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--charcoal);
        }

        .value-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .value-card p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .mission-statement {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(42, 51, 48, 0.02) 0%, rgba(116, 178, 103, 0.02) 100%);
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .mission-statement h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        .mission-statement p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Craftsmanship Section */
        .craftsmanship {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .craftsmanship-content h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        .craftsmanship-content p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .craftsmanship-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--dusty-rose);
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .craftsmanship-image {
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .craftsmanship-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
        }

        /* Timeline Section */
        .timeline-section {
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        .timeline-section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--soft-chartreuse);
        }

        .timeline-item {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            position: relative;
            width: 45%;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
            margin-left: 0;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: 0;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            background: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .timeline-content:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .timeline-year {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--dusty-rose);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-description {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            background: var(--sage);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 20px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before {
            right: -46px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
            left: -46px;
        }

        /* Team Section */
        .team-section {
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        .team-section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .team-member {
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .team-member:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .team-member-image {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .team-member-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .team-member-name {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .team-member-role {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--sage);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .team-member-bio {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Commitment Section */
        .commitment-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--charcoal) 0%, var(--sage) 100%);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .commitment-section h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        .commitment-section p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 3rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .commitment-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .commitment-stat {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .commitment-number {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .commitment-label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .values-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero-about, .craftsmanship {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
            .hero-image-container, .craftsmanship-image {
                order: -1;
            }
            .timeline::before {
                left: 20px;
            }
            .timeline-item {
                width: calc(100% - 50px);
                margin-left: 50px !important;
                margin-right: 0 !important;
            }
            .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before,
            .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
                left: -34px;
                right: auto;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .about-container {
                padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            }
            .about-header h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .values-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 350px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .craftsmanship-stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .mission-values {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .timeline-content {
                padding: 1rem;
            }
            .timeline-year {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="about-container">
    
    <!-- About Header -->
    <div class="about-header editable-section" data-section="700">
        <h1 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="701" data-text="700">Our Story</h1>
        <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="702" data-text="701">A journey of craftsmanship, passion, and timeless design since 2010</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="hero-about editable-section" data-section="703">
        <div class="hero-image-container">
            <img class="hero-image editable-image" data-image="80" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571463/pexels-photo-1571463.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800&h=1000&fit=crop" alt="ÆTHER Studio">
        </div>
        <div class="hero-content editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="704">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="705" data-text="702">Crafting Spaces That Tell Stories</h2>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="706" data-text="703">ÆTHER was born from a simple yet profound belief: that our surroundings profoundly shape our experiences. Founded in 2010 by interior designer Elena Vasquez, our studio began as a small atelier dedicated to creating pieces that bridge the gap between art and function.</p>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="707" data-text="704">What started as a passion project has grown into a globally recognized brand, but our core philosophy remains unchanged. We believe in slow design—taking the time to understand materials, honor craftsmanship, and create pieces that will be cherished for generations.</p>
            <div class="highlight-quote editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="708" data-text="705">"Design is not just about how things look—it's about how they make you feel, how they shape your daily rituals, and how they become part of your story." — Elena Vasquez</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mission & Values Section -->
    <div class="mission-values editable-section" data-section="709">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="710" data-text="706">Our Philosophy</h2>
        <div class="values-grid">
            <div class="value-card editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="711">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-gem"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="712" data-text="707">Uncompromising Quality</h3>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="713" data-text="708">We source only the finest materials and partner with master artisans who share our dedication to excellence. Every piece undergoes rigorous quality checks before it reaches your home.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="714">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-hands"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="715" data-text="709">Artisan Craftsmanship</h3>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="716" data-text="710">Each piece is handcrafted by skilled artisans using techniques perfected over generations. We celebrate the human touch and the beauty of imperfection.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="717">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="718" data-text="711">Sustainable Practice</h3>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="719" data-text="712">We're committed to ethical sourcing, minimal waste, and creating pieces designed to last a lifetime. Sustainability isn't a trend—it's our responsibility.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-statement editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="720">
            <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="721" data-text="713">Our Mission</h3>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="722" data-text="714">To create thoughtfully designed objects that elevate everyday living, celebrating the intersection of form, function, and the human experience.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Craftsmanship Section -->
    <div class="craftsmanship editable-section" data-section="723">
        <div class="craftsmanship-content editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="724">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="725" data-text="715">The Art of Craftsmanship</h2>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="726" data-text="716">Our commitment to quality begins with material selection. We work directly with suppliers who share our values, sourcing premium woods, natural fibers, and sustainable materials from around the world.</p>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="727" data-text="717">Each piece is then brought to life by our network of master artisans—potteries in Portugal, textile weavers in India, and woodworkers in Japan—who apply techniques refined over centuries. The result is furniture and decor that carries the story of its making.</p>
            <div class="craftsmanship-stats">
                <div class="stat-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="728">
                    <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="729" data-text="718">47</div>
                    <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="730" data-text="719">Quality Checks</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="731">
                    <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="732" data-text="720">120+</div>
                    <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="733" data-text="721">Hours Per Piece</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="734">
                    <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="735" data-text="722">98%</div>
                    <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="736" data-text="723">Sustainable Materials</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="craftsmanship-image">
            <img class="editable-image" data-image="81" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6464922/pexels-photo-6464922.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800&h=600&fit=crop" alt="Artisan at work">
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Section -->
    <div class="timeline-section editable-section" data-section="737">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="738" data-text="724">Our Journey</h2>
        <div class="timeline">
            <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="739">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="740" data-text="725">2010</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="741" data-text="726">The Beginning</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="742" data-text="727">Elena Vasquez opens a small studio in Brooklyn, crafting custom furniture and decor pieces for local clients.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="743">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="744" data-text="728">2014</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="745" data-text="729">First Collection</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="746" data-text="730">Launch of our first signature collection, "Elemental," featuring organic forms and sustainable materials.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="747">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="748" data-text="731">2017</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="749" data-text="732">Global Recognition</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="750" data-text="733">ÆTHER is featured in Architectural Digest and opens its first flagship showroom in Manhattan.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="751">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="752" data-text="734">2021</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="753" data-text="735">Digital Innovation</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="754" data-text="736">Launch of our virtual design studio, allowing clients worldwide to collaborate with our designers remotely.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="755">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="756" data-text="737">2024</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="757" data-text="738">Sustainable Future</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="758" data-text="739">Achieving 98% sustainable sourcing and launching our circular design initiative.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Team Section -->
    <div class="team-section editable-section" data-section="759">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="760" data-text="740">Meet the Team</h2>
        <div class="team-grid">
            <div class="team-member editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="761">
                <img class="team-member-image editable-image" data-image="82" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181690/pexels-photo-1181690.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=400&h=400&fit=crop" alt="Elena Vasquez">
                <div class="team-member-info">
                    <div class="team-member-name editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="762" data-text="741">Elena Vasquez</div>
                    <div class="team-member-role editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="763" data-text="742">Founder & Creative Director</div>
                    <div class="team-member-bio editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="764" data-text="743">With over 20 years of experience in interior design, Elena leads our creative vision and ensures every piece reflects our commitment to timeless elegance.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="team-member editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="765">
                <img class="team-member-image editable-image" data-image="83" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/220453/pexels-photo-220453.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=400&h=400&fit=crop" alt="Marcus Chen">
                <div class="team-member-info">
                    <div class="team-member-name editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="766" data-text="744">Marcus Chen</div>
                    <div class="team-member-role editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="767" data-text="745">Head of Product Design</div>
                    <div class="team-member-bio editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="768" data-text="746">Marcus brings a background in architecture and furniture design, creating pieces that balance structural integrity with organic beauty.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="team-member editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="769">
                <img class="team-member-image editable-image" data-image="84" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181686/pexels-photo-1181686.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=400&h=400&fit=crop" alt="Sophia Rodriguez">
